"tr":"tarak"}]},{"text":"கைந்நில்","tr":"kainnil","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கைந்","tr":"kain"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"நில்","tr":"nil"}]},{"text":"லாவே","tr":"lāvē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"லா","tr":"lā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வே","tr":"vē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"அளிது","parts":[{"text":"அளிது","lemma":"அளிது","gloss":"pitiable thing"}],"gloss":"pitiable"},{"surface":"ஓ","parts":[{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ஓ","gloss":"particle of exclamation"}],"gloss":"indeed"},{"surface":"தானே","parts":[{"text":"தான்","lemma":"தான்","gloss":"itself"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"itself"},{"surface":"நாணே","parts":[{"text":"நாண்","lemma":"நாண்","gloss":"modesty"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"modesty"},{"surface":"நம்மொடு","parts":[{"text":"நம்","lemma":"நாம்","gloss":"us"},{"text":"ஒடு","lemma":"ஒடு","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"with us"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நனி","parts":[{"text":"நனி","lemma":"நனி","gloss":"much"}],"gloss":"very much"},{"surface":"நீடு","parts":[{"text":"நீடு","lemma":"நீடு","gloss":"long time"}],"gloss":"for a long time"},{"surface":"உழந்தன்று","parts":[{"text":"உழந்தன்று","lemma":"உழந்தன்று","gloss":"it suffered"}],"gloss":"it suffered","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மன்னே","parts":[{"text":"மன்","lemma":"மன்","gloss":"past/assertion particle"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"indeed"},{"surface":"இனியே","parts":[{"text":"இனி","lemma":"இனி","gloss":"now"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"but now"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வான்பூங்","parts":[{"text":"வான்பூங்","lemma":"வான்பூங்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கரும்பின்","parts":[{"text":"கரும்பின்","lemma":"கரும்பின்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"ஓங்குமணற்","parts":[{"text":"ஓங்குமணற்","lemma":"ஓங்குமணற்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"சிறுசிறை","parts":[{"text":"சிறுசிறை","lemma":"சிறுசிறை","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"தீம்புனல்","parts":[{"text":"தீம்","lemma":"தீமை","gloss":"sweet"},{"text":"புனல்","lemma":"புனல்","gloss":"water"}],"gloss":"sweet water"},{"surface":"நெரிதர","parts":[{"text":"நெரி","lemma":"நெரி","gloss":"crush/overflow"},{"text":"தர","lemma":"தருதல்","gloss":"to cause"}],"gloss":"overflowing and crushing"},{"surface":"வீய்ந்து","parts":[{"text":"வீய்ந்து","lemma":"வீய்ந்து","gloss":"having perished"}],"gloss":"having perished","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"காஅங்கு","parts":[{"text":"காஅங்கு","lemma":"காஅங்கு","gloss":"like holding back"}],"gloss":"like holding back","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தாங்குமளவை","parts":[{"text":"தாங்கும்","lemma":"தாங்கு","gloss":"bearing"},{"text":"அளவை","lemma":"அளவை","gloss":"limit"}],"gloss":"the limit of bearing"},{"surface":"தாங்கி","parts":[{"text":"தாங்கு","lemma":"தாங்கு","gloss":"bear"},{"text":"இ","lemma":"இ","gloss":"verbal participle suffix"}],"gloss":"having borne"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"காம","parts":[{"text":"காம","lemma":"காம","gloss":"desire"}],"gloss":"desire","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நெரிதர","parts":[{"text":"நெரி","lemma":"நெரி","gloss":"crush/overflow"},{"text":"தர","lemma":"தருதல்","gloss":"to cause"}],"gloss":"overflowing and crushing"},{"surface":"கைந்நில்லாவே","parts":[{"text":"கைந்நில்லாவே","lemma":"கைந்நில்லாவே","gloss":"does not stand in control"}],"gloss":"does not stand in control","split_unverified":true}]}],"literal":"Pitiable indeed is modesty, with us / very much, for a long time, it suffered indeed, but now / of the sugarcane with white flowers, on the high sand, the small dam / as the sweet water overflows and crushes, like it perishes, / bearing as much as it could bear, / as desire overflows and crushes, it does not stand in control.","translation":"Pitiable indeed is my modesty! It has endured and stayed with me for a very long time. But now, just like a small sand-dam on the high dunes where white-flowered sugarcane grows is swept away and destroyed when sweet water overflows, my modesty, having borne all it could bear, no longer stands in my control as passion overflows and crushes it.","modern":"என்னோடு சேர்ந்து இவ்வளவு காலம் மிகவும் பொறுமையுடன் துன்பத்தைத் தாங்கிக் கொண்டிருந்த என் நாணம் மிகவும் பரிதாபத்திற்குரியது! வெள்ளை நிறப் பூக்களைக் கொண்ட கரும்புகள் வளரும் உயர்ந்த மணல் பரப்பில் அமைக்கப்பட்ட சிறிய அணை, பெருகி வரும் இனிமையான நீர் மோதி உடைந்து போவதைப் போல, தாங்கக் கூடிய அளவு வரை தாங்கிவிட்டு, இப்போது காம நோய் பெருகி நெருக்கடி தருவதால், என் நாணம் என் கட்டுப்பாட்டில் நில்லாமல் அழிகிறது.","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her close friend, expressing her inability to control her passion any longer. Her husband or lover has been away for a long time, and her longing has reached its peak. She feels her modesty, which she guarded so carefully, is now breaking under the pressure of her desire. The image of a fragile sand-dam built on high sand where white-flowered sugarcane grows, being overwhelmed and destroyed by a sudden rush of sweet water, beautifully mirrors her modesty being swept away by the overwhelming flood of desire. This poem belongs to the pālai (separation) landscape, depicting the intense internal struggle and suffering of the heroine.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.7],[0.7,1.1],[1.1,1.5],[1.5,1.78],[1.78,2.9],[2.9,3.6],[3.6,3.9],[3.9,5.1],[5.1,5.3],[5.3,6.2],[6.2,6.6],[6.6,7.6],[7.6,7.9],[7.9,8.4],[8.4,8.4],[8.4,9.38],[9.38,10.0],[10.0,10.54],[10.54,10.83],[10.97,11.64],[11.64,12.0],[12.0,12.4]],"female":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.7],[0.7,1.1],[1.1,1.44],[1.44,1.44],[1.44,1.5],[1.5,3.8],[3.8,4.2],[4.2,5.5],[5.5,5.7],[5.7,6.16],[6.16,7.3],[7.3,8.3],[8.3,8.6],[8.6,9.0],[9.0,9.0],[9.0,10.41],[10.41,10.41],[10.41,10.89],[10.89,12.3],[12.3,12.8],[12.8,13.1],[13.1,13.5]]}}